{'symbol': 'WLTW', 'date': '2021-05-21 15:45:00', 'title': 'WILLIS TOWERS WATSON ANNOUNCES REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'ARLINGTON, VA. AND LONDON, MAY 21, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- WILLIS TOWERS WATSON (NASDAQ: WLTW), A LEADING GLOBAL ADVISORY, BROKING AND SOLUTIONS COMPANY, ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS APPROVED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.71 PER COMMON SHARE FOR THE QUARTER ENDED MARCH 31, 2021. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON OR ABOUT JUNE 15, 2021 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MAY 31, 2021.'}